Short: MetalScan v1.03 - new features.  SCAN/BROWSE application for CNet
Type: comm/cnet
Uploader: Tom Martinello (marti3@server.uwindsor.ca)
Author: Ray Akey
Replaces: metalscan_101f.lha

MetalScan is a VERY powerful replacement/companion for CNet's SCAN function
because of it's excellent configurability!

MetalScan is more powerful than CNet's built-in SCAN command in many ways.

Features: all current CNet scan options, plus the following additional
          options:

          - display/list TOTALLY configurable using Metalsoft's SLToken(tm)
            system.
          - Filesize smaller or larger than x (smaller and larger
            can be used in combination to list files in a given range of
            sizes.
          - missing items
          - total size of listed files.
          - dates as "intro" to next set of "samne day" files.
          
          New features:
          - multiple language/text sets
          - user preferences saved to his mail dir.
          - prefs saved sperately for Base and UDBase.
          - Even more display options and display tokens.

This software may be included on CDRom/disk collections.
